{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailer Park Zombie</strong> is a chaotic survival roguelite FPS packed with relentless waves of zombies, great selection of weapons, and non-stop action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104850/extras/f807444f18553c7f3fb5e9b7bfa3fe86.avif?t=1757832507\" width=630 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite hillbilly character and take on hordes of zombified Billies and Karens in a fight for survival.  <br> <br>Each character brings unique traits to help you survive longer and dominate the undead apocalypse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104850/extras/53f70ca0bd75cd43c450c3c2c15f2e06.avif?t=1757832507\" width=630 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable character has their different traits to survive longer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Waves of Zombies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly Generated Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters and weapons with progression </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken`s</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 90\u2019s Shooter Aesthetics...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104850/extras/66f1e6128e7168623dcc866d9f9c8536.poster.avif?t=1757832507\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104850/extras/66f1e6128e716862